        "explanation_html": "<section class=\"dtos-explanation\" aria-label=\"DTOS trade assessment\"><h3>DTOS trade assessment</h3><p class=\"tw-final-verdict\">NOT WORTH IT</p><section class=\"tw-decision\" aria-label=\"Trade decision summary\"><section class=\"tw-decision-lead\" aria-label=\"Decision and next step\"><p>Why this decision: The supported lineup cost is not compensated by Market or depth evidence.</p><p>Next step: Do not pursue this package on the recorded evidence. Review its costs before editing.</p></section><section class=\"tw-decision-market\" aria-label=\"Current Market comparison\"><h4>Current Market</h4><div class=\"tw-market-caption\"><span>You send <b>325</b></span><span>You receive <b>325</b></span></div><div class=\"tw-market-bar\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Current Market totals are equal.\"><span class=\"neutral\" style=\"flex-basis:50.000%\"></span><span class=\"neutral\" style=\"flex-basis:50.000%\"></span></div><p>Current Market totals are equal.</p><small>Current values, not trade-date grades. Market advantage is separate from strategy and lineup impact.</small></section><p class=\"tw-drawback\">Optimal legal-lineup production falls 10.00 points per supported week; Reserve replacement production is unavailable for some requested weeks</p><p class=\"tw-drawback\">Projection evidence is Unavailable; retained numerical evidence is provisional, not freshly verified.</p><section class=\"tw-team-summary\" aria-label=\"Current projected lineup effects\"><section><h4>Your team</h4><p>Your team: Conditional Season 2026, week 8 optimal-lineup change -10.00 projected points.</p></section><section><h4>Their team</h4><p>Their team: Conditional Season 2026, week 8 optimal-lineup change +0.00 projected points.</p></section></section><p>Inspect the main drawback, edit or reevaluate this trade.</p><details class=\"tw-team-impact-details\"><summary>Both teams \u00b7 depth, costs and conditions</summary><h4>Your team</h4><p>Conditional average across s